        rdfs:label "hasVariant" ;
        rdfs:comment "Every `to` Element is a variant the `from` Element (`from` hasVariant `to`)."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/implementedBy> a owl:NamedIndividual,
